tion rate of byproduct increases by 50%"}],"modules":[{"type":"Original","name":"Greyy's Badge","stages":[]},{"type":"Upgrade","name":"SPC-Y: New Beginning","mission":{"requirement1":"Complete a total of 5 battles; You must deploy your own Greyy, and have Greyy defeat at least 8 enemies","requirement2":"Clear Main Theme 2-3 with a 3-star rating using a squad of at most 4 units (including Support Units); a non-Support Greyy must be in the squad and only Vanguard operators are allowed for the remaining units"},"stages":[{"stage":"Stage 1","attributesIncreased":"HP +75 , Cost -8 , ASPD +3","effectLabel":"New trait","effectText":"Reduces Deployment Cost","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Semi-Synthetic Solvent","quantity":4},{"name":"LMD","quantity":20000}]},{"stage":"Stage 2","attributesIncreased":"HP +135 , Cost -8 , ASPD +4","effectLabel":"Electrostatic Field improved","effectText":"Slows the target for 0.8 seconds when attacking","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Data Supplement Stick","quantity":15},{"name":"Orirock Cluster","quantity":5},{"name":"LMD","quantity":25000}]},{"stage":"Stage 3","attributesIncreased":"HP +170 , Cost -8 , ASPD +5","effectLabel":"Electrostatic Field improved","effectText":"Slows the target for 1 seconds when attacking","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Data Supplement Instrument","quantity":5},{"name":"RMA70-12","quantity":6},{"name":"LMD","quantity":30000}]}]}],"review":{"official":"Greyy, approved for entry into\nRhodes Island\nafter passing a battery of exams, has great potential for the\nArts\n.\nCurrently serving Rhodes Island as a\nCaster\n, working primarily in power supply maintenance.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":45,"base":{"hp":629,"atk":324,"def":52,"res":10,"redeploy":70,"dp":29,"block":1,"interval":2.9},"max":{"hp":899,"atk":457,"def":79,"res":10,"redeploy":70,"dp":29,"block":1,"interval":2.9},"rangeId":"2-3"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":60,"base":{"hp":899,"atk":457,"def":79,"res":15,"redeploy":70,"dp":32,"block":1,"interval":2.9},"max":{"hp":1168,"atk":587,"def":109,"res":15,"redeploy":70,"dp":32,"block":1,"interval":2.9},"rangeId":"3-6"},{"elite":2,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":70,"base":{"hp":1168,"atk":587,"def":109,"res":20,"redeploy":70,"dp":32,"block":1,"interval":2.9},"max":{"hp":1537,"atk":699,"def":130,"res":20,"redeploy":70,"dp":32,"block":1,"interval":2.9},"rangeId":"3-6"}],"trust":{"hp":300,"atk":0,"def":0}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging test for this Operator showed blurry outline of internal organs with visible unusual dark spots. Unusually high concentration of Originium particles were present in his circulation, indicating signs of infection and confirming him as infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 7.2% \nNo major infection symptom yet to appear on body's surface, but testing found internal infection. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.3u/L \nInfection is more severe within organs than in subject's circulatory system."},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"Greyy was born in a city in Bolívar. His father was an unskilled worker and his mother worked in a care home. Both of them were in poor health. With both parents earning very little, the family barely made ends meet.\nGreyy's childhood was much different from that of his peers. He is introverted and practical like his father, and he is physically weak like his mother. However, Greyy has a knack for Arts. He would have had a promising career on the back of his talent, would that he didn't get infected."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Greyy is decently skilled in the use of electricity and Originium. By quickly increasing the voltage of an operating unit, he can make the positive and negative ions collide and create energy. \nHe learned about Originium from his mother, though he is unsure why an ordinary person like her would have had such a detailed knowledge of Arts. \nHe lived in a slum that suffered from regular blackouts. Because of this, Greyy decided to collect discarded Originium fragments near a smelting plant. He focused their energy into his staff to create a temporary light source. \nThe staff, of course, was also made using repurposed materials."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"Greyy lost his family, so joining Rhodes Island has an extra special meaning for him. His mastery of electrical energy Arts got him a job maintaining the generators at Rhodes Island.\nGreyy is honest, quiet, deferential and always grateful that he gets to be of help to Rhodes Island. \nPerros are known for their loyalty. Even unlucky Perros who are infected, like Greyy, will cherish any companions who share the same difficult and lonely path."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"[Classified Log] \nInformation about the whereabouts of Greyy's parents has not yet been obtained. Perhaps they have passed away. Perhaps they have been taken into quarantine. After all, his parents were both infected, so it is safe to say he probably caught the infection from them. In any case, it is imperative we help him adapt to life at Rhodes Island. Even if kids his age are aware of the fate of their loved ones, learning the truth can have a negative impact on their mental state. Taking care of these children, guiding them, and changing their destiny is your responsibility, Doctor. Certainly, your duties aren't easy. Sometimes even I think the load is too heavy for you to bear. But don't children like Greyy make you believe there's still hope?"}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Greyy%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Greyy%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Elite 2","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Greyy%20-%20Elite%202.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Greyy%20-%20Elite%202.webp"},{"label":"Eggcellent Craftsman","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Greyy%20-%20Eggcellent%20Craftsman.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Greyy%20-%20Eggcellent%20Craftsman.webp"},{"label":"My Fellow Newsboy","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Greyy%20-%20My%20Fellow%20Newsboy.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Greyy%20-%20My%20Fellow%20Newsboy.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{"Eggcellent Craftsman":"40 DC / 400 UC"},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Caster","type":"class","entries":[{"operatorName":"Eyjafjalla","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Eyjafjalla%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"All [Caster] Operators' ATK +16% (+2%) when Eyjafjalla is deployed","matchedKeyword":"Caster"}]},{"operatorName":"Mostima","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Mostima%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"When deployed, increases the SP recovery rate of all Casters by +0.4/second (only the highest effect of this type takes place)","matchedKeyword":"Caster"}]},{"operatorName":"Rosmontis","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Rosmontis%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"When deployed, grants +8% ATK to this unit and a random deployed Caster Operator","matchedKeyword":"Caster"}]},{"operatorName":"Lava the Purgatory","operatorIconPath":"/five-star-icons/Lava%20the%20Purgatory%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"Immediately obtains 35 (+5) SP after first deployment. On each deployment, grants SP +5 (+1) to other Caster allies on the field. When deployed, other Caster allies obtain