":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"Hi, Doctor. If you need anything, please tell me...  Um, I assume you still remember my code name...?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"Doc-Doctor, hi... Um, I just checked the Medical Department's power grid, and taking some files around while I'm at it... No, nobody's forcing me! I mean, they take such good care of me, it's the least I can do for them...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"I decided to learn electric Arts just so my friends back in the slums could have some light, just so the nights would be a little less miserable... That pitch black, it's really scary. And the kinds of people who live in the dark, they can be scary too...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"These Originium generators here at Rhodes Island are amazing... You know, if we had anything like them back home, we wouldn't need to live in the dark all the time, like life without light is normal.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"My mother taught me the basics of Arts. She told me I use Arts just like she did when she was younger, but I'm also as sickly as she was... If she were still alive, I'd hope she could come with me to Rhodes Island...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Talk after Promotion 2","text":"Doctor, before I got the training from you, all I could do with my Arts was light up one little room. But now that little spark has turned into something that can help lots of people...! Thank you so much!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":6},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"Huh? A current anomaly in Miss Mayer's storeroom? W-why is it her again... What? Dr. Kal'tsit wants more cables for her lab? And another outage in Ifrit's room? Waahhhh... Doctor, help meee...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"Zzz... Wha? Doctor...? Ah! Sorry! I wasn't napping! I, um, I was... Oh, is this Medical?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"Doctor, are you going out again...? Okay, I know. I'll wait here for you... Um, Doctor, please hurry back...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"Whoa...! Aaaugh... Static electricity. Gave me a jolt...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"H-Hi. My name is Greyy. I'm kind of an electrician... Erm, th-thanks for taking me on...!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"C-could you pause it for a minute? I-I'm taking notes…","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"A promotion? Okay, I'll take it to... Huh? It's, it's for me...? Really?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Promotion 2","text":"Hehe. Doctor, I shall light the way for you!... Um, sorry, just got too full of myself...  But I actually mean it...!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":14},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"Everyone, I'm here to help...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"I'm the Captain...? O-Okay! If that's your wish, Doctor!...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Let me handle the logistical support...!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"Doctor, I see the enemies rallying...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"I'll try my best…","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"I should be able to do it...!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Slowly, and carefully...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"Can't tiwst my ankle now!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"Stop being evil!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"I won't let you hurt my friends...!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"T-Take that!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"An electric shock c-can really hurt...!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"Doctor, we've done a wonderful job...! Cou-Could we go home now?...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"We-We won, Doctor!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"Doctor, the ones who ran off... We won't see them again, will we?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"Err... Doctor...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"What am I doing today?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Whoa…","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"Doctor, you're really tall... I-I wonder when I'll get to be that tall...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Happy New Year, Doctor. Well, er... there's a fireworks show coming up, and I was wondering if we could watch it together. Yes, I like fireworks. They're so small, yet so bright and colorful, shining over the land...","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Doctor, you're back!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"Here's my birthday present for you, Doctor... Um, I didn't have the money to buy anything nice, so I made something myself... a candle that won't be blown out. May it light a corner of your room and never go out.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"Doctor... I've been studying electrical engineering in depth lately. It's a little tough... but I'll work hard! I want to illuminate more places for Rhodes Island, and for everyone... I, I'm sorry, I'm getting ahead of myself, aren't I?","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Maihan"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/main/current/char_253_greyy/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Mai Fuchigami"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/main/current/char_253_greyy/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["Z"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/main/current/char_253_greyy/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["So Yeon"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/main/current/char_253_greyy/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}